        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 12:51AM EDT until September 25 at 1:00AM EDT by NWS Wakefield VA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and
waves 2 to 4 ft expected.

* WHERE...James River from JRB to HRBT, Including the Elizabeth
River.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
